---
const photo = "https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/2aa38480-2f74-435b-95bf-c31793a1bb39.png";
---

<section class="py-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-stretch">

    <!-- Left: photo -->
    <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-auto min-h-0 order-1">
      <img
        src={photo}
        alt="Typesetting"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Right: text -->
    <div class="bg-[rgba(217,217,217,0.1)] flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-8 md:px-10 py-10 sm:py-12 order-2">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase leading-snug text-black mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        HEARST Book Studio A Leading Typesetting Company
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Great writing deserves a great stage. At HearEst Book Studio, our
        typesetting specialists craft interiors that are as beautiful as they are
        readable — balancing font choice, leading, kerning, and spacing to create
        a harmonious reading experience your audience will never want to put down.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed">
        We bring decades of typographic expertise to every project, working across
        fiction, non-fiction, academic, and illustrated titles. Our team works
        closely with you to align every design decision with your book's tone,
        genre conventions, and target readership — delivering print-ready and
        digital-ready files on time, every time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
  <p class="text-[#555] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
    Typesetting is the art of arranging type so that readers absorb your words effortlessly. At HearEst
    Book Studio, we treat every page as a canvas — selecting typefaces that match your genre, setting
    optimal line lengths for comfort, and ensuring visual rhythm flows from chapter to chapter. Whether
    your book is a literary novel, a business guide, or a children's title, our typesetting transforms
    raw text into a publication that looks and feels truly professional.
  </p>
</div>
